</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="S3.F4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S3.F4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Layerwise effects of targeted word-recovery intervention for Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct.</span>
The line plot shows task performance under targeted intervention applied starting from each transformer layer, while the shaded area shows the corresponding word recovery score at the intervention starting layer under character-level tokenization.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
