<a href="#S2.SS2.p1.1" title="2.2 Models and Datasets ‣ 2 Background ‣ Word Recovery in Large Language Models Enables Character-Level Tokenization Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.2</span></a>,
<a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p3.1" title="Tokenization Robustness. ‣ 6 Related Works ‣ Word Recovery in Large Language Models Enables Character-Level Tokenization Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§6</span></a>.
</span></li>
